From 5126b0ccdf5a542169bf9304c2f86111ec756605 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sangwook Han <sangwook.han@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 09:00:47 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Scope Android font-scale limits to individual regions

The app-wide 1.3 cap no longer governs the compact timer, the
full-screen Timers workspace and Details. Each region now applies
its own limit: the mini timer 1.0, Timers 1.5, Details 1.5. The
Main shooting body keeps its existing 1.0 pin. Other overlays (the
shooting filters screens and the exact-alarm banner) are wrapped in
the previous 1.3 cap so their behavior is unchanged.

Investigation experiment on the Spec PR candidate boundaries; not
yet tied to an approved spec revision.

PTIMER-235 Android font scale

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../sangwook/ptimer/app/ui/FontScaleCap.kt    |  5 ++
 .../com/sangwook/ptimer/app/ui/ShootingApp.kt | 86 +++++++++++--------
 2 files changed, 54 insertions(+), 37 deletions(-)

diff --git a/android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/sangwook/ptimer/app/ui/FontScaleCap.kt b/android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/sangwook/ptimer/app/ui/FontScaleCap.kt
index 9d681154..1554a73a 100644
